ive.org/web/20011101021918/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/msha.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/tarot.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"49\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:38/49\" width=\"38\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Tarot Cards</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;트린식히든벨리에 있다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">팁란에 비밀장소를 참조하시길</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011101021918/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/mtarot.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/smallvase.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"32\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:55/32\" width=\"55\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"45\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/lrgvase.gif\" width=\"33\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Small vase</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">블튼 동쪽 공동묘지</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011101021918/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/mvase.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/pot.gif\" width=\"15\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/poth.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:19/15\" width=\"19\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/rustypot.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:24/18\" width=\"24\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dirtypan.gif\" width=\"27\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"21\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/frypan.gif\" width=\"23\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Pot&amp;Pan</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Covetous Corpser Room?&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>-</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/chess.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:47/20\" width=\"47\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Chessman</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">루머로는 &nbsp;셔펜홀드에있다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">UOAM: x3064, y3384</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>-</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"38\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/Tray.gif\" width=\"36\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Wooden Tray</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;코베던전에 잇다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">스카라의레인져헛간에도... </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(x5618, y1883)</font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011101021918/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/mtray.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/skullcandle.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"29\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/29\" width=\"15\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"14\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/champagneglass.gif\" width=\"12\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Skull with Candle,Globlet</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;디싯던전 1층에 잇다</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>-</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"53\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/hay.gif\" width=\"52\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"205\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Hay</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"419\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">채찍구하는4곳중에 좌측에 있는헛간</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"19\" width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011101021918/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/mhay.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></p>\n<ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> \np.s</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> : 한달레어나 루머도 많큼 가격이 어마어마하고 \n구하기도 힘듭니다</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">이중에는 \n                    진레어(서버 처음 만들 때 나오는 <b>진레어</b>도 포함이 될 \n                    수 있습니다)</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">레어를 구하고 한달이냐 섭다운기준으로 한달이냐 의견이 \n분분합니다..</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">일단은 각아템을 지정할 때 젠의 기준과 시간을 데타방식으로 \n                    저장하는 것 같습니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">르네이후 아니면 그이전부터 데이터를 가지고 농락을 하는지도-_-;;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">르네이후 젠을 아예 막았을지도 모릅니다..</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">하지만 리젠 포인트는 확실하다고 할 수 있습니다..</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">이유는 르네이전에 그장소에 없었던 레어들이 르네이후 모든레어들을 \n                    재정비 할 때</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">나타난 것입니다-_-;;; 그것들은 모두 유저들이 집어 갔다고 \n                    결론을 내릴 수 있습니다..</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">위에 장소보다도 더많은 곳에서도 집을 수 있었을것입니다....</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그러므로 현재는 아템마다 리젠날짜가 다르다는게중론입니다..(올쥔마음-\"-)</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"gray\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Written By Forg</b></font></p>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_2/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/wyrmsheart.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"42\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/42\" width=\"30\"></font></a></p>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"right\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_2/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top.gif\" width=\"50\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
